# Variable names only. No values are stored here.
# Copy the names you need into the gitignored file deploy/compose/.env.
# This application does not load a dotenv file by itself.
# Compose injects deploy/compose/.env into containers. Do not commit that file.
# IB_HOST and IB_PORT below stay empty. The compose file pins 127.0.0.1 and 4002.

